    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 29 • Job Interview 2",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Sam currently runs his own company selling used office furniture online. He's tired of running his own business and wants to get a job with a big company."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your résumé that you're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "running your own show"
                },
                {
                  "text": " as the owner of OldOfficeChair.com."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Sam: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's right. I've "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "carved out a niche"
                },
                {
                  "text": " selling used office chairs over the Internet."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That sounds like a great business. Sam: I was "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "making money hand over fist"
                },
                {
                  "text": " after the dot-com bust.* Companies were "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "going belly up"
                },
                {
                  "text": " every day, and I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "snapped up"
                },
                {
                  "text": " all their chairs "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "for a song"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". But these days it's becoming harder and harder to find used chairs."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Wouldn't you rather continue working for yourself?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Sam: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "No, I'm tired of working for myself."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I can "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "see the writing on the wall"
                },
                {
                  "text": ": you'll "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "jump ship"
                },
                {
                  "text": " when you think up another good business idea."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Sam: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "No, I won't. I'd always wanted to be an entrepreneur, but I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "got that out of my system "
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I realize now that"
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "it's not all it's cracked up to be"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "It certainly isn't. You work really hard and you're just as likely to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "strike out"
                },
                {
                  "text": " as you are to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "strike it rich."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Sam: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Tell me about it! My best friend invested all his money in starting a company. He ended up "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "losing his shirt!"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Right, we all know people like that...One final point about the position. As you know, this is a large corporation. Are you sure you wouldn't be happier at a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "start-up"
                },
                {
                  "text": "?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Sam: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Start-ups"
                },
                {
                  "text": " are exciting, but at this point in my life, I'm looking for stability over excitement. I've got four kids at home, and they like to eat!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nick: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "I hear what you're saying"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". We could use somebody around here who thinks like an entrepreneur. If you're someone who can "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "take the ball and run with it"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", you'd be a great addition."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
